---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AgentLine Install | 安装与部署"
  description="安装、源码运行、远程访问和排障入口。"
>
  <Header activePage="install" />
  <main id="main-content" class="topic-main page-install">
    <section class="topic-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Install</p>
        <h1>从安装到远程登录，一次走通</h1>
        <p class="lead">目标是降低启动门槛：读完就能装，装完就能连。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="anchor-wrap">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="anchor-strip" aria-label="Install anchors">
          <a href="#quickstart">最快启动</a>
          <a href="#source">从源码运行</a>
          <a href="#remote">远程访问</a>
          <a href="#troubleshooting">常见问题</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container snap-deck">
      <section id="quickstart" class="story-panel">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/overview-projects-real.png" alt="Project overview after launching AgentLine locally" width="1440" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">01 / Quickstart</p>
          <h2>最快启动</h2>
          <pre class="code"><code>npm i -g agentline
agentline</code></pre>
          <p>启动后打开本地地址，进入会话监督面板。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="source" class="story-panel is-reverse">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/sessions-list-real.png" alt="Run from source and manage sessions in one view" width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">02 / Source</p>
          <h2>从源码运行</h2>
          <pre class="code"><code>git clone https://github.com/april-jk/AgentLine.git
cd agentline
pnpm install
pnpm start</code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="remote" class="story-panel">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/session-complete-real.png" alt="Configured desktop session after install" width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">03 / Remote</p>
          <h2>启用远程访问</h2>
          <p>按设置向导选择连接模式（直连 / 中继 / 自托管），完成后可在移动端登录。</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="/remote" class="btn btn-primary">启动后登录</a>
            <a href="/security-relay" class="btn btn-secondary">查看安全说明</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="troubleshooting" class="story-panel is-reverse is-mobile-shot">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/sessions-list-mobile-real.png" alt="Troubleshooting and response workflow on mobile" width="430" height="932" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">04 / Troubleshooting</p>
          <h2>常见问题</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>端口被占用</li>
            <li>本机会话未识别</li>
            <li>远程连接失败</li>
            <li>移动端通知未到达</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="section final-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>把等待代理，变成调度代理。</h2>
        <a href="/remote" class="btn btn-primary">立即登录你的服务器</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
